---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ProcessFlow from "../components/ProcessFlow.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Wayne Omni connects strategy, creative, media and technology.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Wayne Omnipotent · Malaysia" title="One partner across the growth journey." intro="Wayne Omni is the public-facing name of Wayne Omnipotent: a Malaysia-registered marketing business bringing web development, acquisition, content and automation into one connected practice." />
  <section class="about-grid">
    <div><h2>Built for businesses that have outgrown disconnected execution.</h2></div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>Many businesses do not have a channel problem. They have a handoff problem: the ad makes one promise, the page tells another story, the form lacks context and the follow-up arrives too late.</p>
      <p>Wayne Omni works across that whole path. Experience includes website development, landing pages, Meta, Google, TikTok and LinkedIn advertising, Facebook, Instagram and Redbook content, email marketing, CRM workflows and measurement.</p>
      <p>The goal is not to add complexity. It is to make the customer journey clearer and the marketing operation easier to improve.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section dark-section">
    <span class="eyebrow light">A connected practice</span>
    <h2 class="large-section-title">From first attention to the next decision.</h2>
    <ProcessFlow dark />
  </section>
  <section class="language-band">
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>English</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>中文</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>Bahasa Melayu</strong></div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
